              }
            ],
            "rationale": "The blocking rules for borrow, hold and renew are now Tier 2 guards (Loans.borrow, Holds.place, Loans.renew). The change also removes the Tier 4 CLI code that summed fines and payments and compared the total to 5.00m, and it removes the CLI's direct call to Loans.renew. The new `standing` and `members` flags call Accounts.isBlocked in Tier 2 and only render the result. The CLI makes no domain decisions.",
            "score": 2
          },
