                "file": "src/Lending.Transition/Accounts.fs",
                "line": 28,
                "quote": "| Some m when balance >= Policy.blockingBalance m.Type -> Error(blocked (memberId, balance, Policy.blockingBalance m.Type))"
              }
            ],
            "rationale": "The per-type rule is added only in Tier 2 (Policy and Accounts). Tier 1 changes only to carry the limit in the error values. Tier 3 and Tier 4 are untouched except that Views now formats the limit it is given. No site outside Tier 1/2 decides which limit applies. borrow, hold, renew, standing and members all inherit the new rule through isBlocked and ensureNotBlocked.",
